        <mxCell id="runner" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#8C4FFF;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 4;strokeWidth=1.5;verticalAlign=top;align=center;spacingTop=8;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#232F3E;" value="&lt;b&gt;GitHub-hosted runners&lt;/b&gt; · ubuntu-latest&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;outside AWS, no VPC attachment&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;.github/workflows/eks-upgrade.yml&lt;br&gt;1 · validate: pluto · terraform fmt / validate&lt;br&gt;2 · terraform-plan: plan posted to the PR&lt;br&gt;3 · terraform-apply: environment-gated&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; pre-upgrade-checks.sh (7 checks)&lt;br&gt;4 · argocd-sync: sync, wait, then&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; post-upgrade-validation.sh (6 checks)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;auth: OIDC, no stored AWS keys&lt;br&gt;pluto 5.19.4 · terraform 1.13.0 · argocd CLI v3.0.5&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
